G1921.b:
⟪ἐπι-γινώσκω⟫
[in LXX chiefly for ⁨נָכַר⁩: hi., also for ⁨יָדַע⁩, etc. ;] "directive" of γινώσκω (AR, Eph., 249), as in cl.;
⟪1.⟫ ⟪to observe, perceive, discern, recognize⟫;
⟪(a)⟫ absol.: ⟦Acts 25:10|Ac 25:10⟧, ⟦1 Corinthians 13:12|I Co 13:12⟧; seq. ὅτι, ⟦Luke 1:22|Lk 1:22⟧; τ. πνεύματι, seq. ὅτι, ⟦Mark 2:8|Mk 2:8⟧;
⟪(b)⟫ c. acc rei: ⟦Luke 1:4|Lk 1:4⟧ ⟦Luke 5:22|5:22⟧, ⟦Acts 12:14|Ac 12:14⟧ ⟦Acts 27:39|27:39⟧, ⟦Romans 1:32|Ro 1:32⟧, ⟦2 Corinthians 1:13|II Co 1:13⟧, ⟦Colossians 1:6|Col 1:6⟧, ⟦1 Timothy 4:3|I Ti 4:3⟧; ἐν ἐαυτῷ, ⟦Mark 5:30|Mk 5:30⟧; seq. ὅτι, ⟦1 Corinthians 14:37|I Co 14:37⟧;
⟪(c)⟫ c. acc pers.: ⟦Matthew 11:27|Mt 11:27⟧ ⟦Matthew 14:35|14:35⟧ ⟦Matthew 17:12|17:12⟧, ⟦Mark 6:33|Mk 6:33⟧ (T, αὐτούς, but LTr., WH, R, omit the pron., and LTr., WH, txt., read ἔγνωσαν), ⟦Mark 6:54|ib. 54⟧, ⟦Luke 24:16|Lk 24:16⟧, ⟦Luke 24:31|31⟧, ⟦1 Corinthians 16:18|I Co 16:18⟧, ⟦2 Corinthians 1:14|II Co 1:14⟧; seq. ἀπό, c. gen. rei, ⟦Matthew 7:16|Mt 7:16⟧, ⟦Matthew 7:20|20⟧; seq. ὅτι, ⟦Acts 3:10|Ac 3:10⟧ ⟦Acts 4:13|4:13⟧, ⟦2 Corinthians 13:5|II Co 13:5⟧; pass., ⟦1 Corinthians 13:12|I Co 13:12⟧; opp. to ἀγνοούμενοι, ⟦2 Corinthians 6:9|II Co 6:9⟧.
⟪2.⟫ ⟪to discover, ascertain, determine⟫: ⟦Acts 9:30|Ac 9:30⟧; seq. ὅτι, ⟦Luke 7:37|Lk 7:37⟧ ⟦Luke 23:7|23:7⟧, ⟦Acts 19:34|Ac 19:34⟧ ⟦Acts 22:29|22:29⟧ ⟦Acts 24:11|24:11⟧ ⟦Acts 28:1|28:1⟧; c. acc rei, seq. quæst., ⟦Acts 23:28|Ac 23:28⟧; δι’ ἣν αἰτίαν, ⟦Acts 22:24|Ac 22:24⟧; παρά, c. gen. pers., seq. περί, c. gen. rei, ⟦Acts 24:8|Ac 24:8⟧; τ. ὁδὸν τῆς δικαιοσύνης, ⟦2 Peter 2:21|II Pe 2:21⟧ (cf. Lft., Col., 136; Cremer, 159; M, Pr., 113; AR, Eph., 248 ff.).†

G1980.b:
⟪ἐπι-σκέπτομαι⟫
(late form of ἐπισκοπέω, q.v.), [in LXX very freq., chiefly for ⁨פָּקַד⁩ ;]
⟪1.⟫ ⟪to inspect, examine⟫.
⟪2.⟫ (a) ⟪to visit⟫: c. acc, ⟦Acts 7:23|Ac 7:23⟧ ⟦Acts 15:36|15:36⟧ (cf. ⟦Judges 15:1|Jg 15:1⟧); especially, the sick and afflicted (as in MGr. and sometimes in cl.), ⟦Matthew 25:36|Mt 25:36⟧, ⟦Matthew 25:43|43⟧, ⟦James 1:27|Ja 1:27⟧ (cf. Si 7:35);
⟪(b)⟫ in LXX and NT (as ⁨פָּקַד⁩ in ⟦Genesis 21:1|Ge 21:1⟧, ⟦Exodus 4:31|Ex 4:31⟧, ⟦Psalms 8:5|Ps 8:5⟧, al.), ⟪to visit with help, to care for⟫: ⟦Luke 1:68|Lk 1:68⟧, ⟦Luke 1:78|78⟧ ⟦Luke 7:16|7:16⟧, ⟦Acts 15:14|Ac 15:14⟧, ⟦Hebrews 2:6|He 2:6⟧;
⟪(c)⟫ ⟪to visit with punishment⟫ (⟦Jeremiah 9:25|Je 9:25⟧, ⟦Psalms 89:33|Ps 88(89):33⟧, al.; cf. MM, Exp., xiv; Cremer, 863).†
